	\L_011b6:
	\L_0119a:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　　Demon Lord Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki, having awakened as the'
	R
	'Demon Lord, was sitting with'
	R
	'her legs crossed in the throne.'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Her eyes were different from'
	R
	'when she was human. They were'
	R
	'more cold and inorganic, and'
	R
	'gave off a stinging light.'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Hornet and Silky were kneeling'
	R
	'before her.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01162:
	ZH 1:
	'Forgiven.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'It wasn’t outwardly apparent'
	R
	'what Miki was forgiving.'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'However, Hornet and Silky'
	R
	'seemed to immediately'
	R
	'understand and accepted.'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'They slowly raised their heads.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	!VAR0516 : 35!
	\L_01226:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'Lord Miki...'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01162:
	ZH 1:
	'...Who are you referring'
	R
	'to...?'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'Excuse me, I meant Little'
	R
	'Princess.'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve long anticipated your'
	R
	'awakening...'
	R
	'I’m truly happy.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0120a:
	ZH 1:
	'Hornet lowered her head again.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01162:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'You demons were always going'
	R
	'on about the Demon Lord and'
	R
	'trying to make me into it...'
	R
	'I thought it’d be greater...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'But this is it...?'
	R
	'Boring.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki rested her head in her'
	R
	'hand. She looked truly bored.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0117e:
	ZH 1:
	'Boring world...'
	R
	'Boring people...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'If everything’s boring, I’ll'
	R
	'destroy it all along with that'
	R
	'man...'
	R
	'And myself too, eventually...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s why I became the Demon'
	R
	'Lord... To kill him...'
	R
	'To control the demons...'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Little Princess slowly stood'
	R
	'up.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01162:
	ZH 1:
	'Hornet...'
	R
	'Silky...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'I became the Demon Lord...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'But I’m not just going to'
	R
	'create the world you want.'
	R
	'When the time comes, it’ll be'
	R
	'too late for regrets.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'To demons, the word of the'
	R
	'Demon Lord is absolute...'
	R
	'I will have no regrets.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01234:
	!VAR0516 : 73!
	\L_01226:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'I think the same as Ms.'
	R
	'Hornet, Little Princess.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Silky and Hornet both bowed to'
	R
	'Little Princess.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0117e:
	ZH 1:
	'Boring...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Worthless...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'The world is so wretched'
	R
	'without you, Kentarou...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Even now that I’m Demon Lord,'
	R
	'can I really feel anything?'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Aside from...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Desire to kill Rance...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s so irritating...'
	R
	'Boring... Dull...'
	R
	'Really irritating...'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Little Princess walked from'
	R
	'the throne to the balcony and'
	R
	'looked out at the world.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
