	'Do you believe me??'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01162:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki didn’t look at Kayblis,'
	R
	'and instead gazed out the'
	R
	'balcony from the throne.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... Lord Miki??'
	R
	'Are you listening??'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Kayblis tilted his head to the'
	R
	'side and shuffled up to Little'
	R
	'Princess.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0120a:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜gsh＞'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah...'
	\L_01287:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaaaaaaah!!'
	R
	'My... My... My eeeeye!!'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki thrust her arm into one'
	R
	'of Kayblis’s eyes. It pierced'
	R
	'through and stuck in up to her'
	R
	'elbow.'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_01162:
	ZH 1:
	'Shut up...'
	R
	'Insect...'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_011d2:
	ZH 1:
	'I-I’m sorry, I’m sorryyy!'
	\L_01287:
	\L_0127a:
	\L_0119a:
	ZH 1:
	'Kayblis put pressure on his'
	R
	'eye and frantically begged for'
	R
	'forgiveness.'
	\L_01287:
